// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`skillUtils > skillCreationInstructions > should return consistent instructions for skill creation (snapshot) 1`] = `
"
**Instructions:**

1. Change to the working directory: \`cd "/Users/test/project"\`

2. Run the bash script below (copy and execute the commands from the script)

3. This will create the blade skill at \`.agents/skills/blade/SKILL.md\` and a symlink at \`.claude/skills/blade\`

Run the following bash script to create the blade skill:

**Bash Script:**

\`\`\`bash

  #!/bin/bash
  # Install the blade skill from GitHub (SKILL.md + references)
  SKILL_DIR=".agents/skills/blade"
  SYMLINK_DIR=".claude/skills/blade"
  rm -rf "$SKILL_DIR"
  mkdir -p "$SKILL_DIR"
  npx -y degit razorpay/blade/packages/blade-plugin/skills/blade "$SKILL_DIR" --force
  # Create symlink for Claude Code support
  mkdir -p ".claude/skills"
  if [ ! -L "$SYMLINK_DIR" ] && [ ! -e "$SYMLINK_DIR" ]; then
    ln -s "../../.agents/skills/blade" "$SYMLINK_DIR"
  fi
  # Remove the legacy ui-code-guidelines skill superseded by the blade skill
  rm -rf ".agents/skills/ui-code-guidelines" ".claude/skills/ui-code-guidelines"
  
\`\`\`

**Working Directory:** \`/Users/test/project\`

Alternatively, install the Blade Claude Code plugin, which ships the same \`blade\` skill and needs no MCP: https://github.com/razorpay/blade/tree/master/packages/blade-plugin
"
`;
